{"seq":3,"slug":"data-migration-versioning","title":"数据迁移与版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/data-migration-versioning","wordCount":1300,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据迁移与版本管理\">数据迁移与版本管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>离线同步系统的 schema 演进面临独特挑战：新旧版本客户端共存并互相同步数据。核心概念包括：安全操作分类（additive-only vs destructive）、版本兼容窗口（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 版本向后兼容）、客户端迁移策略（VersionedSchema / AutoMigration / 懒迁移）、跨版本同步的 <code>_overflow</code> 字段保护、以及迁移失败时的回滚与灾难恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离线同步系统的演进悖论\">离线同步系统的演进悖论</h2><p>离线同步系统面临一个传统 API 应用不存在的难题：<strong>客户端带着旧 schema 的数据库离线运行，而服务端和其他客户端可能已经升级到新 schema</strong>。在 REST 应用中，API 版本化只需要服务端向后兼容；在离线同步应用中，新旧 schema 的客户端可能同时在线，互相同步数据，任何不兼容都可能导致同步崩溃或数据损坏。</p>\n<p>核心约束：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mtext>ActiveVersions</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Sync</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> must not fail</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall v_i, v_j \\in \\text{ActiveVersions}: \\text{Sync}(v_i, v_j) \\text{ must not fail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ActiveVersions</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sync</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> must not fail</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即任何两个活跃版本之间的同步操作必须安全完成——即使彼此不理解对方新增的字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-演进的安全操作分类\">Schema 演进的安全操作分类</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作类型</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>同步兼容性</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>添加可选字段</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>旧客户端忽略新字段</td>\n<td><code>ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN tags TEXT</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加新表</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>旧客户端不同步新表</td>\n<td><code>CREATE TABLE comments(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加默认值</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>旧客户端写入时用默认值</td>\n<td><code>priority INTEGER DEFAULT 0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段重命名</td>\n<td>危险</td>\n<td>旧客户端无法识别新字段名</td>\n<td>需双写过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除字段</td>\n<td>危险</td>\n<td>旧客户端可能继续写入该字段</td>\n<td>需先标记废弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改字段类型</td>\n<td>极危险</td>\n<td>类型不匹配导致解析崩溃</td>\n<td>需新字段 + 迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除表</td>\n<td>极危险</td>\n<td>旧客户端同步时找不到表</td>\n<td>需确认所有客户端已升级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"版本兼容窗口策略\">版本兼容窗口策略</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    V1[&quot;V1 (旧)&quot;] --&gt; V2[&quot;V2 (当前)&quot;]&#10;    V2 --&gt; V3[&quot;V3 (新)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;兼容窗口 N=2&quot;&#10;        V2 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;互相兼容&quot;| V3&#10;        V1 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;互相兼容&quot;| V2&#10;        V1 -.-&gt;|&quot;不保证兼容&quot;| V3&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    V1[\"V1 (旧)\"] --&gt; V2[\"V2 (当前)\"]\n    V2 --&gt; V3[\"V3 (新)\"]\n\n    subgraph \"兼容窗口 N=2\"\n        V2 &lt;--&gt;|\"互相兼容\"| V3\n        V1 &lt;--&gt;|\"互相兼容\"| V2\n        V1 -.-&gt;|\"不保证兼容\"| V3\n    end</pre><p>兼容窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的定义：当前版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>current</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{current}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须与最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个旧版本保持同步兼容。</p>\n<p>实践建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>消费级应用：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>（覆盖约 95% 用户的更新窗口，约 2-4 周）</li>\n<li>企业级应用：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 3-4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>（企业 MDM 推送更新较慢）</li>\n<li>强制升级触发条件：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>client</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>current</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{client}} &lt; V_{\\text{current}} - N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">client</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 时，提示用户强制升级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"客户端迁移策略\">客户端迁移策略</h2><h3 id=\"ios-swiftdata-versionedschema\">iOS：SwiftData VersionedSchema</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 版本 1：初始 schema&#10;enum AppSchemaV1: VersionedSchema {&#10;    static var versionIdentifier = Schema.Version(1, 0, 0)&#10;    static var models: [any PersistentModel.Type] { [NoteV1.self] }&#10;&#10;    @Model final class NoteV1 {&#10;        var id: UUID&#10;        var title: String&#10;        var content: String&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 版本 2：添加 tags 和 priority&#10;enum AppSchemaV2: VersionedSchema {&#10;    static var versionIdentifier = Schema.Version(2, 0, 0)&#10;    static var models: [any PersistentModel.Type] { [Note.self] }&#10;&#10;    @Model final class Note {&#10;        var id: UUID&#10;        var title: String&#10;        var content: String&#10;        var tags: [String]?      // 新增，可选&#10;        var priority: Int?       // 新增，可选&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum AppMigrationPlan: SchemaMigrationPlan {&#10;    static var schemas: [any VersionedSchema.Type] {&#10;        [AppSchemaV1.self, AppSchemaV2.self]&#10;    }&#10;    static var stages: [MigrationStage] {&#10;        [.lightweight(fromVersion: AppSchemaV1.self, toVersion: AppSchemaV2.self)]&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 版本 1：初始 schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppSchemaV1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VersionedSchema </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> versionIdentifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Schema.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> models: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PersistentModel.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] { [NoteV1.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @Model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NoteV1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id: UUID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> title: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#7